{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229111-requesting-odd-weapon-combinations","id":1229111,"title":"Requesting odd weapon combinations?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-21T01:14:21-07:00","id":1229111,"title":"Requesting odd weapon combinations?","content":"Hello all, I was just wondering what are some of the weird weapon combinations you have had in your game. I should note that I don't mean temporary stuff like grabbing your demon familiar and using it as an improvised weapon, but stuff that is just odd combinations of normal &amp; artifact weapons. <br /> <br /> This came to mind because of an idea I had of using Sirrush from Arms of the Chosen in one hand, and a Goremaul in the other which sounds weird as hell but a build entirely built around Smashing and Force without Fire sounds fun, and entirely effective.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T05:58:32-07:00","id":1229133,"title":"","content":"A Lunar who uses an artifact bow to fight remotely, and resorts to tooth and claw against anything that manages to get close.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T07:09:41-07:00","id":1229143,"title":"","content":"Hmm sensible weapon combos like paired weapons won't do. So, what about a smashfist and whip. A shield wall AKA dual wield shields sounds funny though. Extra defense and clash bonuses, and not much else . . .<br /> <br /> I have a character that uses the Frost thorn knuckles but still carries his old spear. I like the idea of using an oversized weapon and using its weight to spin around and kick, so maybe the old school god-kicking boot comboed with a goremaul or grimscythe.<br /> <br /> The Hell-Boy special: big smashfist and a flame piece","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24220,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","user":"Cryo-Seraph","date":". 06-21-2018, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T18:19:39-07:00","id":1229266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229111-requesting-odd-weapon-combinations?p=1229133#post1229133\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A Lunar who uses an artifact bow to fight remotely, and resorts to tooth and claw against anything that manages to get close.</div> </div> </div> </div>I made a custom artefact siege bow thats about 2 feet taller than the petite Liminal who fires it. It was made for a first age user who was about 8 feet tall. After being passed over and passed around, the bow started to float on its own and now reacts to the performing the bow-pull actions in the air. <br /> <br /> For weird combos, a player of mine has rank 2 ambidextrous (feet work like hands) so he can Brawl, Single Point, AND Flame Piece as he sees fit. <br /> <br /> Another character (npc) weilds a flamewand/bayonet and a whip (Bloodborne style).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Please be warned: this is not champagne, this is most likely a duck.<br /> -<i>Chausse</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\"><i>Message me for Japanese translations.</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8830-sorcerous-overlord","name":"Sorcerous Overlord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8830_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T19:59:36-07:00","id":1229280,"title":"","content":"An axe...on a rope, so you can swing it while you swing it. Or an artifact one on a bladed soulsteel chain, name it Silent Fall and give it evocations based around causing battle groups to fall without making a sound.<br /> <br /> Orichalcum helmet whose evocations are entirely based around headbutting your enemies.<br /> <br /> Moonsilver dentures that shapeshifting to give you a terrifying bite attack, and have evocations built on biting off limbs and parrying blades by catching them in your teeth and then either disarming it breaking them.<br /> <br /> Armor made of white Jade, causes people who attack you to become gravitationally bonded to you so you can body slam them into things. Capstone evocation called Emerald Prince's Duty let's you roll up armies Katamari style.<br /> <br /> A volleyball pole, complete with rope and a ball. For smiting, tripping, unexpected attacks from behind, and just tying people to the pole. Artifact version is made of Starmetal and rapidly ages or de-ages opponents based on whether you're spinning it clockwise or counterclockwise.<br /> <br /> Artifact boots that just make you jump real high...but all their combat evocations are built around coming back down from that height and punching folks from above with meteoric momentum.<br /> <br /> Magic eyepatch made from Malfean brass. Solipsistic magic makes it so you can't be hurt from the side you can't see, screwing over enemies who try to take advantage of your blind side. Mechanically just call it &quot;wielding an artifact shield&quot;, and give it some evocations for lighting nearby people on green fire if they beat your awareness with their stealth because you not noticing them means they must not be real and so it starts burning them out of reality.<br /> <br /> Fancy twirly skirt with Moonsilver blades woven into the hem. Evocations for dancing and dance fighting, twirling and sashaying across the battlefield like an exquisitely choreographed blender.<br /> <br /> A goremaul-harpoon. You can smite with it...or throw it and impale the enemy with a barbed pole that's got nine hundred pounds of blue Jade on one end, and evocations based on hindering mobility or dragging a foe (or a ship?) to the bottom of the sea like an anchor.<br /> <br /> Glass eye with orichalcum Iris. You can shoot it out of your head to smite people at range (artifact sling/sling bullet stats), and blind them with sunburst flares and purple after images. Evocation tree lets you use Awareness to see through it at a distance and attack with it once it's out. A bit like that whistle-arrow from Guardians of the Galaxy, only grosser.<br /> <br /> You know those nutcracker implements they give you to crack shells with when you order crab at a seafood place? That, but six feet long. Uses seven section staff stats, evocations for breaking enemy armor or deforming it to reduce mobility.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T20:05:55-07:00","id":1229281,"title":"","content":"Wise Old Guru: I love the eye patch, and the Glass Eye thing is gross as hell but awesome <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-21T20:26:25-07:00","id":1229285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Citadel97501</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229111-requesting-odd-weapon-combinations?p=1229281#post1229281\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wise Old Guru: I love the eye patch, and the Glass Eye thing is gross as hell but awesome <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Eye am pleased that you enjoyed them. Iris a little worried you would think they were too silly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T00:06:26-07:00","id":1229316,"title":"","content":"how about footwear with dance-Performance related evocatioons. for those times you need to defeat your enemies in a dance-off competion","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T14:49:29-07:00","id":1229458,"title":"","content":"A fishing pole with a fire-breathing lizard tied to the end of the string like a lure; allows one to either use it as a whip or make attacks as with a flame piece out to Medium range.<br /> <img src=\"https://78.media.tumblr.com/c2908f20d4965903b3550db3a6a13ca1/tumblr_inline_nzqwo4cJTP1r9nvqi_500.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T15:12:28-07:00","id":1229463,"title":"","content":"Flame-pieces as nunchucks<br /> <br /> Bladed hula-hoop<br /> <br /> a sack full of hedgehogs","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-22T18:21:38-07:00","id":1229491,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229111-requesting-odd-weapon-combinations?p=1229463#post1229463\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Bladed hula-hoop</div> </div> </div> </div>Giant chakrams are kind of a favorite design of mine as well. And the game needs heavy thrown weapons more, so I'm all for it. Just make the close attacks kept in your hands or around your body.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24220-cryo-seraph","name":"Cryo-Seraph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-23T11:51:49-07:00","id":1229626,"title":"","content":"bladed hula-hoop speciality: offensive hip thrusts","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-23T12:06:08-07:00","id":1229632,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229111-requesting-odd-weapon-combinations?p=1229626#post1229626\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">bladed hula-hoop speciality: offensive hip thrusts</div> </div> </div> </div>Direlance codpiece.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-23T12:25:38-07:00","id":1229636,"title":"","content":"Ponytail direlash with Moonsilver wire hair extensions. Evocations based around &quot;I whip my hair back and forth.&quot;<br /> <br /> Orichalcum brass knuckles that are also an ocarina with musical evocations.<br /> <br /> Invisible grand goremaul with stealthy evocations named The Unspeakable Elephant. <br /> <br /> God Kicking Boots that are platform shoes. Moonsilver, with evocations to make you always taller than whoever you are talking to/fighting. Capstone let's you ignore legendary size when you kick warstriders in the face with your extendo-boots.<br /> <br /> Unbreakable Glass Goldfish bowl on a soulsteel chain. Traps the ghosts of its victims as tiny phantasmal fishies, evocations based on using it as a glowing lure and distraction gambits to make your opponents just randomly forget you are there.<br /> <br /> Arrow that, when fired, causes you and your bow to fly backwards several hundred feet while the arrow just hangs in the air and vibrates...and then explodes.<br /> <br /> Gambler's Ruin, a six-chambered artifact firewand with evocations for playing Russian Roulette. If you load only one chamber and spin it before you fire, for each action you fire it and nothing happens you bank Initiative/deadly bonus effects for when it actually finally goes off.<br /> <br /> Spear that sticks in people when you stab them...and then rapidly and usuy fatally grows into a small tree , some of whose branches are new spears. Not an artifact or anything, just a sorcerously created species of tree that relies on a symbiotic relationship with local humans for reproduction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-23T13:01:15-07:00","id":1229641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wise Old Guru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229111-requesting-odd-weapon-combinations?p=1229632#post1229632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Direlance codpiece.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> well if its a melee specialty it should work for any kind of weapon","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}